      "content": "i don't know... seeing myself doesn't change the fact that i'm just taking up space. it feels like i'm just a background character in everyone else's life. honestly it feels more like i'm just a ghost that hasn't realized it's dead yet. it would be so much easier if i actually was gone, then i wouldnt have to deal with this emptiness.",
